            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LoveJoy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made a 2-apple recipe, with 2 teaspoons cinnamon, and crushed walnuts/brazil nuts combo. Next time I will try pecans or macadamias! Too much juice, poured out a lot before serving.",
            "datePublished": "2012-04-08T22:04:30.857Z"
